cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Clinical Literature Search Skill"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill that performs systematic clinical literature searches
  using PubMed and Scholar Gateway. Given a clinical topic, it searches for
  current national guidelines and published evidence, then produces a
  structured evidence summary document, a YAML reference ledger, and
  Zotero-compatible reference exports.
version: 1.4.0
